    <ul>
      <li>Wine belongs to everyone.</li>
      <li>Every bottle has a story.</li>
      <li>History tastes better in a glass.</li>
      <li>Curiosity matters more than scores.</li>
      <li>Great wine is about people before prestige.</li>
